{"speciesId":152,"names":{"fr":"Germignon","es":"Chikorita","en":"Chikorita","ja":"チコリータ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up the sun's rays."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaves have the ability to check the hu­ midity and tem­ perature."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It loves to bask in the sunlight. It uses the leaf on its head to seek out warm places."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"In battle, CHIKORITA waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling POKéMON and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"In battle, CHIKORITA waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling POKéMON and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It waves its leaf around to keep foes at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly atmosphere that becalms the battlers."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaves have the ability to check the humidity and temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up the sun’s rays."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up sunrays."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaf has the ability to check humidity and temperature."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il jauge la température et l’humidité grâce à la feuille sur sa tête. Il raffole des bains de soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il jauge la température et l’humidité grâce à la feuille sur sa tête. Il raffole des bains de soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un doux parfum émane de la feuille placée sur sa tête. Il est très gentil et aime dormir au soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Un dulce aroma se desprende de la hoja de su cabeza. Es dócil y le encanta absorber los rayos de sol."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up sun rays."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の 葉っぱから ほのかに 甘い 香りが 漂う。おとなしくて 日差しを 浴びるのが 大好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il jauge la température et l’humidité grâce à la feuille sur sa tête. Il raffole des bains de soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con la hoja de su cabeza puede medir la temperatura y la humedad. Le encanta tomar el sol."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭の 葉っぱで まわりの 温度や 湿度を 探る。 日差しを 浴びることが 大好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsqu’il se bat, Germignon secoue sa feuille pour tenir son ennemi à distance. Un doux parfum s’en dégage également, apaisant les Pokémon qui se battent et créant une atmosphère agréable et amicale."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al luchar, Chikorita agita la hoja que tiene para mantener a raya al rival. Pero, al mismo tiempo, libera una suave fragancia que apacigua el encuentro y crea un ambiente agradable y de amistad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"In battle, Chikorita waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling Pokémon and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"葉っぱを 振り回して 相手を 威嚇するが 葉っぱから 甘い 香りが 漂うので お互いに 和やかな 雰囲気に なるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’il se bat, Germignon secoue sa feuille pour tenir son ennemi à distance. Un doux parfum s’en dégage également, apaisant les Pokémon qui se battent et créant une atmosphère agréable et amicale."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al luchar, Chikorita agita la hoja que tiene para mantener a raya al rival. Pero, al mismo tiempo, libera una suave fragancia que apacigua el encuentro y crea un ambiente agradable y de amistad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In battle, Chikorita waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling Pokémon and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"葉っぱを 振り回して 相手を 威嚇するが 葉っぱから 甘い 香りが 漂うので お互いに 和やかな 雰囲気に なるよ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":152,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[4,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"